[1;33m[WARN][0m   Review: changes_requested (8 issue(s)) — The implementation for AMSD-2041 (Live Preview of Content in CMS) is a complete non-implementation. None of the prescribed minimal fixes from the Root Cause Analysis were applied: (1) The Contentstack SDK Stack is initialized without any `live_preview` configuration, so the SDK never processes live preview data. (2) The `ContentstackContext` is a bare `createContext({})` with no Provider component, no `useState`, no `useEffect`, and no `onEntryChange` subscription — the 236+ consumers of `useContent` will always receive static SSR content. (3) The `@contentstack/live-preview-utils` dependency is not installed. (4) Query interfaces (`ICreateQueryConfig`, `ICreateEntryConfig`) were not updated with `live_preview` fields, and query functions do not forward live preview context. (5) No vitest unit tests exist for this feature. Every acceptance criterion related to real-time draft content preview (AC 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7) is unmet. Verdict: changes_requested with 8 blocker-level issues.

